    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108929" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποπερκάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>begin to assume a dark colour, begin to turn,</i> of
			grapes, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕτεραι δ᾽ ὑποπερκάζουσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.126
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.54
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ βότρυς ὑποπερκάζεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ach.Tat.
					2.3
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περκνός.</span></div>
